  "solution": "Phương trình chính tắc của hypebol có dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Hyperbol có tiêu điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Độ dài trục thực bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy phương trình chính tắc của hypebol là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
